  "narrative_premise": "In a dystopian tech company that exploits its workers and secretly harvests user data, you play as Lin, a disillusioned programmer. When you stumble upon evidence of massive data laundering, you must choose your path: collaborate for personal gain, fight for justice through labor organizing, leak to the press, build a worker-owned alternative, or sink into complicity. Every decision reshapes your values and the world around you.",
